{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "role-crud-collection",
		"name": "Level 0 - Role CRUD (Enhanced)",
		"description": "Complete CRUD operations for Role model (Level 0 - No Dependencies)\n\n🔧 **Configuration:**\n- Base URL: http://127.0.0.1:8003\n- Authentication: Admin JWT Token (auto-fetched)\n- Tenant: test_tenant\n- Path: /api/v1/auth/roles/\n\n📋 **2 Endpoints Covered:**\n1. CREATE Role (POST /)\n2. LIST Roles (GET /)\n\n⚠️ **Permissions:**\n- Admin role ONLY\n- Multi-layer security validation\n\n🎯 **Features:**\n- Auto token refresh\n- Response validation\n- Admin-only access control",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{admin_token}}", "type": "string"}]
	},
	"event": [{
		"listen": "prerequest",
		"script": {
			"exec": [
				"if (!pm.globals.get('admin_token')) {",
				"    pm.sendRequest({url: 'http://127.0.0.1:8003/api/v1/auth/test-jwt/admin-token', method: 'GET'}, function (err, response) {",
				"        if (!err) pm.globals.set('admin_token', response.json().access_token);",
				"    });",
				"}"
			]
		}
	}],
	"variable": [
		{"key": "base_url", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8003"},
		{"key": "tenant_schema", "value": "test_tenant"}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. CREATE Role",
			"request": {
				"method": "POST",
				"header": [
					{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
					{"key": "cschema", "value": "{{tenant_schema}}"}
				],
				"body": {
					"mode": "raw",
					"raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Test Role\",\n    \"description\": \"Test role description\"\n}"
				},
				"url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/roles/"
			}
		},
		{
			"name": "2. LIST All Roles",
			"request": {
				"method": "GET",
				"header": [{"key": "cschema", "value": "{{tenant_schema}}"}],
				"url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/roles/"
			}
		}
	]
}